#That should just be a passive
The majority of effects could probably just be proced passives.
Emphasis on crafting, this will become world of War and Craft.

Your loadout and talents will matter much, much more than anything else.
Spell sequencing will be more seamless and more classes will become more streamlined.

Every class will have three specializations that focus on style of play rather than just their dungeon role
Auto-play, tactical, and specialized

Auto-play specialization will rotate at max between 2 or 3 spells. If that. These specializations pretty much just sit there and do their thing.

Tactical specializations will require action bar management and a lot of spell sequencing.

Specialized will be weird and experimental, riffing off of what makes the class unique and going deep into the weird.

